{"id":"404af7df141b9e06","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-quantifier-block-classes.md","title":"Raw syntactic quantifier-block classes (legacy)","display":"df-quantifier-block-classes — Raw syntactic quantifier-block classes (legacy)","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-quantifier-block-classes","aliases":["27-df-quantifier-block-classes"],"display":"df-quantifier-block-classes — Raw syntactic quantifier-block classes (legacy)","depends_on":["[[27-df-formula]]","[[27-df-quantifier-rank]]"],"local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-quantifier-block-classes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-quantifier-block-classes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quantifier-block-classes — Raw syntactic quantifier-block classes (legacy)"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ae3aea7249664c55\" href=\"?note=ae3aea7249664c55\" title=\"27-df-quantifier-rank\">27-df-quantifier-rank</a></span></div>"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a> 的有限树语法；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0,\\mathbf s,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf m\">\\(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf s,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf m\\)</span> 是四个互异形式符号。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\">\\(S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\)</span> 在下式记录一个常量、一个一元函数、两个二元函数、无关系的算术签名，不是标准自然数结构。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n,k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 是该语法的变量集合。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\">\\(Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" href=\"?note=1f9e71c9f1e5764e\" title=\"27-df-formula\">27-df-formula</a> 的对象量词构造子，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\">\\(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Block}_Q\">\\(\\mathrm{Block}_Q\\)</span> 是下式定义的量词块构造函数，输入为有限变量序列及公式；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\langle\\rangle\">\\(\\langle\\rangle\\)</span> 是空序列。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{qr}\">\\(\\mathrm{qr}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ae3aea7249664c55\" href=\"?note=ae3aea7249664c55\" title=\"27-df-quantifier-rank\">27-df-quantifier-rank</a>。保留符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\">\\(\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0\\)</span>，但其载体严格是原始公式树：量词自由初层、交替的非空量词块，不按逻辑或算术语义等价闭包，也不是自然数关系类。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"C_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf0\\},\\qquad F_{\\mathrm{ar},1}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf s\\},\\qquad F_{\\mathrm{ar},2}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf a,\\mathbf m\\},\\qquad F_{\\mathrm{ar},j}\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N,\\ j\\geq3),\\qquad R_{\\mathrm{ar},j}\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N^+).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[C_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf0\\},\\qquad F_{\\mathrm{ar},1}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf s\\},\\qquad F_{\\mathrm{ar},2}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf a,\\mathbf m\\},\\qquad F_{\\mathrm{ar},j}\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N,\\ j\\geq3),\\qquad R_{\\mathrm{ar},j}\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N^+).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\\langle C_{\\mathrm{ar}},(F_{\\mathrm{ar},j})_{j\\in\\mathbb N^+},(R_{\\mathrm{ar},j})_{j\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\rangle.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\\langle C_{\\mathrm{ar}},(F_{\\mathrm{ar},j})_{j\\in\\mathbb N^+},(R_{\\mathrm{ar},j})_{j\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\rangle.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Block}_Q:\\left(\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Var}^k\\right)\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Block}_Q:\\left(\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Var}^k\\right)\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Block}_Q(\\langle\\rangle,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\qquad\\mathrm{Block}_Q(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle,\\varphi)\\coloneqq Qx_1\\,\\mathrm{Block}_Q(\\langle x_2,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle,\\varphi)\\quad\\left(k\\geq1,\\ (x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Block}_Q(\\langle\\rangle,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\qquad\\mathrm{Block}_Q(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle,\\varphi)\\coloneqq Qx_1\\,\\mathrm{Block}_Q(\\langle x_2,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle,\\varphi)\\quad\\left(k\\geq1,\\ (x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_0^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\mid\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)=0\\},\\qquad\\Pi_0^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_0^0,\\qquad\\Delta_0^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_0^0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_0^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\mid\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)=0\\},\\qquad\\Pi_0^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_0^0,\\qquad\\Delta_0^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_0^0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Block}_{\\exists}(\\vec x,\\varphi)\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k,\\ \\varphi\\in\\Pi_n^0\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Block}_{\\exists}(\\vec x,\\varphi)\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k,\\ \\varphi\\in\\Pi_n^0\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Block}_{\\forall}(\\vec x,\\varphi)\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k,\\ \\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\},\\qquad\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\cap\\Pi_{n+1}^0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Block}_{\\forall}(\\vec x,\\varphi)\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k,\\ \\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\},\\qquad\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\cap\\Pi_{n+1}^0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>本文件是目录遗留的一阶逻辑背景（legacy background），不是《Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications》的书内对应原子。本次保留其概念接口并修复类型、绑定和依赖；未取得该书的对应定义或页码，不声称依据原书核验。</li>\n<li>本次保留旧 27 的非空块语法分类，避免未经用户研究目标确认就偷换成标准可计算性中的算术集合层级。已读取 57-df-S-ar 与 57-df-quantifier-block-classes，发现后者已采用允许空块的另一个 raw 分类，故不能继续把它作为当前非空块定义的精确同义上游。</li>\n<li>当前 raw 分类是退化的：每个 n≥1 的 Σ 类首构造子为 ∃，Π 类首构造子为 ∀，标签不同，因此 Δ_n^0=∅；它不是标准 arithmetical hierarchy，不能用来声称 Δ_1^0 是可判定集合类。该区别已移入 Hypothesis 和标题，不依赖读者读到此 Remark 才确定载体。</li>\n<li>量词块按变量序列长度递归，空序列返回原公式，每一步使序列长度减一；因此构造终止且唯一。文件名改为 quantifier-block-classes，使名称对应这里保留的原始语法分类。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"ae3aea7249664c55","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-quantifier-rank]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[27-df-formula]] 的有限树语法；$\\mathbf0,\\mathbf s,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf m$ 是四个互异形式符号。$S_{\\mathrm{ar}}$ 在下式记录一个常量、一个一元函数、两个二元函数、无关系的算术签名，不是标准自然数结构。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"1f9e71c9f1e5764e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n,k\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{Var}$ 是该语法的变量集合。$Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}$ 是 [[27-df-formula]] 的对象量词构造子，$\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}$。$\\mathrm{Block}_Q$ 是下式定义的量词块构造函数，输入为有限变量序列及公式；$\\langle\\rangle$ 是空序列。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-quantifier-rank","status":"resolved","id":"ae3aea7249664c55","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{qr}$ 见 [[27-df-quantifier-rank]]。保留符号 $\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0$，但其载体严格是原始公式树：量词自由初层、交替的非空量词块，不按逻辑或算术语义等价闭包，也不是自然数关系类。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf0,\\mathbf s,\\mathbf a,\\mathbf m","display":false},{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{ar}}","display":false},{"tex":"n,k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"Q\\in\\{\\forall,\\exists\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Block}_Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{qr}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_n^0,\\Pi_n^0,\\Delta_n^0","display":false},{"tex":"C_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf0\\},\\qquad F_{\\mathrm{ar},1}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf s\\},\\qquad F_{\\mathrm{ar},2}\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf a,\\mathbf m\\},\\qquad F_{\\mathrm{ar},j}\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N,\\ j\\geq3),\\qquad R_{\\mathrm{ar},j}\\coloneqq\\varnothing\\quad(j\\in\\mathbb N^+).","display":true},{"tex":"S_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\coloneqq\\langle C_{\\mathrm{ar}},(F_{\\mathrm{ar},j})_{j\\in\\mathbb N^+},(R_{\\mathrm{ar},j})_{j\\in\\mathbb N^+}\\rangle.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Block}_Q:\\left(\\bigcup_{k\\in\\mathbb N}\\mathrm{Var}^k\\right)\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\longrightarrow\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Block}_Q(\\langle\\rangle,\\varphi)\\coloneqq\\varphi,\\qquad\\mathrm{Block}_Q(\\langle x_1,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle,\\varphi)\\coloneqq Qx_1\\,\\mathrm{Block}_Q(\\langle x_2,\\ldots,x_k\\rangle,\\varphi)\\quad\\left(k\\geq1,\\ (x_1,\\ldots,x_k)\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_0^0\\coloneqq\\{\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{S_{\\mathrm{ar}}}\\mid\\mathrm{qr}(\\varphi)=0\\},\\qquad\\Pi_0^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_0^0,\\qquad\\Delta_0^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_0^0.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Block}_{\\exists}(\\vec x,\\varphi)\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k,\\ \\varphi\\in\\Pi_n^0\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\Pi_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\{\\mathrm{Block}_{\\forall}(\\vec x,\\varphi)\\mid k\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\},\\ \\vec x\\in\\mathrm{Var}^k,\\ \\varphi\\in\\Sigma_n^0\\},\\qquad\\Delta_{n+1}^0\\coloneqq\\Sigma_{n+1}^0\\cap\\Pi_{n+1}^0.","display":true}],"bytes":3944,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-318","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-quantifier-block-classes|df-quantifier-block-classes — Raw syntactic quantifier-block classes (legacy)]]"}],"outgoing":["1f9e71c9f1e5764e","ae3aea7249664c55"]}